/T (The Simple Student Management System is a Java program designed to illustrate fundamental concepts of software structure and makes use of Object-Oriented Programming, the Java Collection Frameworks, and File I/O stream operations in order to provide a means of managing records for different student groups.  )
/E (The Simple Student Management System is a Java program designed to illustrate fundamental concepts of software structure and makes use of Object-Oriented Programming, the Java Collection Frameworks, and File I/O stream operations in order to provide a means of managing records for different student groups.  )
