/Title (1. Scanner Buffer Mismatches: The use of scanner.nextInt\(\) caused the line-feed delimiters to remain in the input buffer, thereby causing trailing string inputs to be overlooked. This problem was solved by standardising the input readings onto scanner.nextLine\(\) and then using Integer.parseInt\(\).)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 383 0 R
